Third-Party Software Notices
============================

AstronomyKit wraps the Astronomy Engine C library. The original source code
and full project are available at https://github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Astronomy Engine

AstronomyKit also retains the complete VSOP87B data and the 77 IAU2000B nutation
coefficient rows from Astronomy Engine revision
826e26ff3a6dc03ee46658b1138fef582d96c5d9 under Scripts/model-data, from which
the shipping headers under Sources/CLibAstronomy/generated are produced. Exact
source URLs and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in Scripts/model-data/manifest.json.
VSOP87 is the planetary theory of Pierre Bretagnon and Gerard Francou (Bureau
des Longitudes); the upstream explanatory document is retained as
Scripts/model-data/vsop87.txt.

